msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫...Кто там?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FADEF30D_2ECF_4528_8077_E138ECDF1CCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
